<h1>Why I created Toza.</h1>
<p>People who give important decisions considerable care still entrust much of their digital privacy to vendor defaults. I created Toza to give that part of your life the expert attention it deserves.</p>
<p><strong><a class="btn" href="#contact">Request a private conversation</a></strong></p>
<p class="trust">One senior expert &#xB7; In person &#xB7; With you present &#xB7; Your credentials remain under your control</p>
